                            <comment id="327111" author="gerrit" created="Wed, 23 Feb 2022 16:45:39 +0000">&lt;p&gt;"Vladimir Saveliev &amp;lt;vlaidimir.saveliev@hpe.com&amp;gt;" uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/46596" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/46596&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Subject: &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-15588" title="osd_trans_stop() misses th_sync flag set in top thandle" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-15588"&gt;LU-15588&lt;/a&gt; obdclass: transfer th_sync flag to sub thandle&lt;br/&gt;
